//  06 · a JSON file as a database                             ★★☆ core
//  concepts: fs/promises · JSON · read-modify-write · error codes
//  run: node 06-fs-json-db.js
// ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
//
//  Half the small tools you write keep their state in one JSON file. The
